  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Everyone Counts - Inclusive Data for Stability and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In close partnership with the Ministry for Communities and Territories Development of Ukraine and the State Statistics Services of Ukraine, as well as with territorial communities themselves, IOM will facilitate the enhancement of gender-sensitive data gathering capacities at the local level in Ukraine, and creation of a grassroots data gathering &#x201c;network&#x201d; in support of local preparedness and resilience, including by engaging youth, women and civil society in reporting on the emergency-, recovery-, and stability-related needs of their communities, and by building local capacity for evidence-based and gender-sensitive policy-making.</narrative>
  </description>
